  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Astrologian 20, Diurnal Sect</p><p>At 20th level, while under the Diurnal Sect, the astrologian can emit a 30-foot blazing aura for 1 minute. This acts as a daylight spell. In addition, undead within this radius take an amount of damage equal to her astrologian level each round that they remain inside the aura. Spells and spell-like abilities with the darkness descriptor are automatically dispelled if brought inside this aura. She may use this ability a number of times per day equal to her Wisdom modifier.</p>",
